<title>USA: Florida to sell $6.31 mln regents bonds Thursday.</title>
<headline>Florida to sell $6.31 mln regents bonds Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida will sell $6.13 million of state Board of Regents revenue bonds by competitive bid at 11 a.m. EDT on Thursday, the Division of Bond Finance said.</p>
<p>The issue is Board of Regents, Florida Agricultural and Mechnical University Student Services Center Revenue Bonds, Series 1997.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
